Capstan idle-wait demo · 2026-09-28T20:54:13.632Z
This retained demo exercises nextSignal('decision'); human() is implemented and tested separately.
This is a real wall-clock wait with no workers. It does not demonstrate a multi-day clock jump or an approval API.
